---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About - Poetry Submissions Directory">
	<main class="about-container">
		<a href="/" class="back-link">&larr; Back to Directory</a>
		
		<h1>About This Tool</h1>
		
		<div class="content-block">
			<p>This directory was built to help poets find open markets in the UK and Ireland without relying on scattered Twitter threads or outdated blogs.</p>
			
			<p>It is updated dynamically. The statuses (Open, Closed, Soon) are checked regularly to ensure you are always looking at actionable information.</p>
			
			<h2>How to Use This List</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Open:</strong> They are currently accepting unsolicited submissions. Check their guidelines for specific formatting rules.</li>
				<li><strong>Closed:</strong> Their reading window is currently shut.</li>
				<li><strong>Soon:</strong> They have an upcoming submission window opening shortly.</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>Contact</h2>
			<p>If you run a magazine and need your details updated, or if you spot an error, please reach out.</p>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.about-container {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 3rem 0;
	}

	.back-link {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		color: #555;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.back-link:hover {
		color: #000;
		text-decoration: underline;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	h2 {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	p, li {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: #333;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	ul {
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}
</style>